<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ-E GROUP NET RISES IN NOV.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ-E GROUP NET RISES IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     0.17 vs   0.02</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 0.59 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.72 vs   0.20</p>
<p> Group sales		   13.23 vs   2.89</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     2.88 vs   0.76</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 4.82 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Group operating profit     5.03 vs   1.22</p>
<p> Group sales		  115.74 vs  39.09</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektromontaz Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
